  "description": "GroupDocs.Annotation for .NET is a lightweight but powerful API that offers a wide range of graphics, text, and watermark annotations. Apply annotations to a document and export the result into the desired format. Annotate PDF, DOCX/DOC, PPTX/PPT, XLSX/XLS, JPG, PNG, TIFF, VSDX/VSD, ODT, ODS, ODP, EML, HTML, and many other formats to collaborate, comment and review documents with GroupDocs.Annotation for .NET.",
